      "replacement_text": "Let $A$ be a finite central simple $k$-algebra. Any $k$-algebra\nautomorphism of $A$ is inner. In particular, any $k$-algebra automorphism\nof $\\text{Mat}(n \\times n, k)$ is inner.",
      "source_end_line": 514,
      "source_start_line": 512,
